list.item:
 Richardson, Elliot L., Under Secretary of State
from January 23, 1969, until June 23, 1970; Secretary of Health, Education,
and Welfare from June 1970

person.note:
Assistant to the President for International Economic Affairs, and Executive
                    Director of the Council for International Economic Policy in 1971 and 1972;
                    Secretary of Commerce from January 27 until December 8, 1972

Korea Analyst, Office of Research and Analysis for East Asia and Pacific,
                    Bureau of Intelligence and Research, Department of State, from 1969 until 1972;
                    Country Officer for Korea, Department of State, from 1972

Deputy Assistant Secretary of Defense for Near East and South Asia, 1970;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of Defense for Policy Plans and National Security
                    Council Affairs, 1971
